1
00:00:00,676 --> 00:00:03,926
(Stuart:)Plus, you're forgetting
that the Infinite Crisis story line...

2
00:00:04,096 --> 00:00:06,346
(Stuart:)...restored Joe Chill
to the Batman mythology.

3
00:00:06,515 --> 00:00:08,855
(Sheldon:)I am forgetting nothing,
and I resent your tone.

4
00:00:09,018 --> 00:00:10,518
[SIGHS]

5
00:00:10,894 --> 00:00:14,274
(Stuart:)Okay. Look, Sheldon, it's late.
I've gotta get some sleep.

6
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:16,730
- So I win.
- No, I'm tired.

7
00:00:17,651 --> 00:00:19,861
(Sheldon:)So I win.

8
00:00:20,487 --> 00:00:23,407
- Fine, you win.
- Darn tooting, I win.

9
00:00:24,324 --> 00:00:27,454
(Stuart:)Penny, I really had a terrific time.

10
00:00:28,078 --> 00:00:29,458
(Stuart:)Penny?

11
00:00:29,872 --> 00:00:31,372
(Sheldon:)No, no, no. Don't wake her.

12
00:00:31,915 --> 00:00:34,875
(Sheldon:)She'll maul you like a rabid wolverine.

13
00:00:37,421 --> 00:00:40,341
(Stuart:)You know, I don't think that was decaf.

14
00:00:43,677 --> 00:00:47,137
HOWARD:
Wait, is this your card or isn't it?

15
00:00:49,892 --> 00:00:52,062
(Howard:)Trust me, this was their card.

16
00:00:52,227 --> 00:00:53,897
(Leonard:)I thought you were good at this.

17
00:00:54,063 --> 00:00:57,153
(Leonard:)You're always talking about
how you go to bars and meet women.

18
00:00:57,316 --> 00:00:58,816
(Howard:)I do. All the time.

19
00:00:58,984 --> 00:01:01,654
(Leonard:)Well, what happened?
Been sitting here all night...

